# Public keys that sign the DumbMonit agent binaries (Ed25519, PEM).
#
# Compiled into the agent: a running agent only installs an update whose
# detached signature (<binary>.sig) verifies against one of these keys.
# Several keys may be listed (rotation): add the new one, release, then remove
# the old one a release later.
#
# The private key lives only in the GitHub secret AGENT_SIGNING_KEY of the
# repository. How to create it: docs/development/agent-signing.md.
#
# Key 1, created on 2026-11-02 (first signed release: 0.15.0).
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEASMvWvUC9rUPglhfHL4plPV7MO15bdcUZ+sNpzt7NJGs=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
